# Supabase CLI local state
#
# Written by `supabase link`. It holds the linked project ref and the pooler
# connection string, which describe the live database and belong to whoever ran
# the link -- not to the repository. `supabase/migrations/` is the part that is
# meant to be committed, and it stays tracked.
supabase/.temp/
